==== Alcoholic ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The parameter indicates that the item contains alcohol. Used for alcoholic drinks and alcohol-sterilized bandages.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
Alcoholic = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
